<%- include('public-header', { title: 'About' }) %>

<section class="pub-page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>About the Leisure Marine Association</h1>
    <p>A dedicated advocate for the regional marine industry</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pub-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Who We Are</h2>
    <p>The Leisure Marine Association MENA represents the interests of marinas, boat and yacht manufacturers, service providers, and equipment suppliers across the Middle East &amp; North Africa.</p>
    <p>Our core objective is to promote and facilitate boat and yacht ownership and usage in the region, while advocating for our members and the broader marine industry.</p>

    <h2>Founding &amp; Recognition</h2>
    <p>The Association was established in 2020 under the auspices of the Dubai Chamber of Commerce, and is officially recognized at the Dubai Association Centre.</p>

    <h2>Scope &amp; Focus</h2>
    <p>Our focus extends beyond the UAE to encompass the GCC and wider MENA regions — addressing diverse regional challenges together with our members.</p>

    <h2>Membership Options</h2>
    <p>We offer <strong>full membership</strong> for marine trade professionals and <strong>associate membership</strong> for enthusiasts — fostering inclusivity across the industry.</p>

    <h2>Governance</h2>
    <p>The Association is managed by an Executive Manager and supported by a Board of Directors consisting of voluntary marine industry professionals. Members with full voting rights may stand for election to the board or committees.</p>

    <h2>Committees</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <% committees.forEach(c => { %>
        <div class="feature">
          <h3><%= c.name %></h3>
          <p><strong>Chair:</strong> <%= c.chair %></p>
          <p><strong>Members:</strong> <%= c.members.join(', ') %></p>
        </div>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('public-footer') %>
